{"tool_name":"hncdb","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"HNCDB","home":"http://hncdb.cancerbio.info","license":"Unlicense","summary":"Integrated Gene and Drug Database for Head and Neck Cancer.","addition_date":"2019-08-09T13:06:28Z","last_update_date":"2020-06-16T10:55:25Z","tool_type":["Database portal","Web application"],"accessibility":"Open access","biotools_curie":"biotools:HNCDB","cost":"Free of charge","credit":[{"email":"peixq@sysucc.org.cn","name":"Xiaoqing Pei","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]},{"email":"yangak@sysucc.org.cn","name":"Ankui Yang","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]},{"email":"zuozhx@sysucc.org.cn","name":"Zhixiang Zuo","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Differential gene expression analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3223"},{"term":"Expression correlation analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3463"},{"term":"Text mining","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0306"}]}],"maturity":"Mature","name":"HNCDB","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"hans","publication":[{"doi":"10.3389/FONC.2019.00371","metadata":{"abstract":"\u00a9 2019 Zhang, Li, Su, Zhang, Wang, Yin, Pei, Yang and Zuo.Head and neck cancer (HNC) is the sixth most common cancer worldwide. Over the last decade, an enormous amount of well-annotated gene and drug data has accumulated for HNC. However, a comprehensive repository is not yet available. Here, we constructed the Head and Neck Cancer Database (HNCDB: http://hncdb.cancerbio.info) using text mining followed by manual curation of the literature to collect reliable information on the HNC-related genes and drugs. The high-throughput gene expression data for HNC were also integrated into HNCDB. HNCDB includes the following three separate but closely related components: \u201cHNC GENE,\u201d \u201cConnectivity Map,\u201d and \u201cANALYSIS.\u201d The \u201cHNC GENE\u201d component contains comprehensive information for the 1,173 HNC-related genes manually curated from 2,564 publications. The \u201cConnectivity Map\u201d includes information on the potential connections between the 176 drugs manually curated from 2,032 publications and the 1,173 HNC-related genes. The \u201cANALYSIS\u201d component allows users to conduct correlation, differential expression, and survival analyses in the 2,403 samples from 78 HNC gene expression datasets. Taken together, we believe that HNCDB will be of significant benefit for the HNC community and promote further advances for precision medicine research on HNC.","authors":[{"name":"Li X."},{"name":"Pei X."},{"name":"Su X."},{"name":"Wang H."},{"name":"Yang A."},{"name":"Yin S."},{"name":"Zhang H."},{"name":"Zhang Q."},{"name":"Zuo Z."}],"citationCount":3,"date":"2019-01-01T00:00:00Z","journal":"Frontiers in Oncology","title":"HNCDB: An integrated gene and drug database for head and neck cancer"},"pmcid":"PMC6527845","pmid":"31139565","type":["Primary"]}],"topic":[{"term":"Ear, nose and throat medicine","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3406"},{"term":"Medicinal chemistry","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0209"},{"term":"Oncology","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_2640"}],"validated":1},"bioschemas":{"name":"HNCDB","home":"https://bio.tools/HNCDB","license":"Unlicense","summary":"Integrated Gene and Drug Database for Head and Neck Cancer.","tool_type":"sc:SoftwareApplication"},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:hncdb/db/hncdb.cancerbio.info","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"distribution":{"sourcecode":{"interpreted":true}},"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"license":{"open_source":true,"osi":false},"publications":[{"entries":[{"cit_count":6,"citations":[{"count":1,"year":"2020"},{"count":1,"year":"2026"},{"c